# Design Capability

This capability provides focused design routing modes. Select the mode appropriate for the current design task.

## Modes

| Mode | Skill | When to Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `audit` | `design` | Diagnose why a UI feels generic, uneven, or hard to validate, then route into critique or remediation work |
| `arrange` | `design` | Focus the route on layout, hierarchy, and spatial organization decisions |
| `bold` | `design` | Focus the route on stronger visual conviction and more deliberate emphasis |
| `distill` | `design` | Focus the route on simplification, clutter removal, and clearer priorities |
| `polish` | `design` | Focus the route on final cleanup and finishing passes |
| `typeset` | `design` | Focus the route on typography, rhythm, and readability |
| `context-capture` | `design` | Refresh canonical design context before downstream screen or implementation work |

